{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月8日 12:45 星期日</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>法國連續第四個周末有全國示威，民眾上周六（7日）再度走上街頭抗議，不滿生活成本高企。法國內政部表示，全國約14.6萬人上街，其中巴黎約4.6萬人；法國總工會則稱，全國約25萬人參與，其中巴黎約7.5萬人。當局仍部署約7萬警力戒備。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>巴黎示威抗議接近尾聲時發生警民衝突。有人擲物、燒煙花、襲擊警員，警方施放催淚氣體驅群眾。里昂有人堵路，亦遭警方催淚氣體驅散。（法新社）</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕法國示威 示威 抗議 巴黎 里昂 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.696398+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T04:45:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:16:04.837817+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.869621+00:00","content_hash":"ce5ad31967be3c8d29e8c835bb542100b8bb647aa1d734002b12b035e236de3b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}